            <span class="text-slate-400 text-[10px] font-mono tracking-widest shrink-0 mt-1">Q&middot;02</span>
            <h3 class="flex-1 text-slate-900 font-semibold pr-4">Our clients manage their own infrastructure. This isn&rsquo;t our problem.</h3>
            <span class="faq-plus text-slate-400 text-2xl font-light leading-none shrink-0 mt-0.5">+</span>
          </summary>
          <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mt-3 pl-10">Most agencies say that until a migration stalls because the client can&rsquo;t find the registrar login, or a domain renewal lapses because it was registered under an email address nobody checks. SiteGov maps who controls what before you need it, not after you&rsquo;re already on a call trying to recover it.</p>
